   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bioteknologi 04-10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen med projektet &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka den m&#xe4;nskliga resursbasen inom molekul&#xe4;r biologi och bioteknology genom st&#xf6;d till forskarutbildning inom omr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives:   1. Molecular studies on filariasis with special reference to targets for drug development;   2. Molecular studies on the effect of maternal nutrition on reproduction;   3. Continuation of research programmes commenced earlier on.</narrative>
